# Debian Packaging for echomind

Package: echomind
Version: 0.3.2-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Maintainer: Pinak Dhabu <pinak@echomind.dev>
Build-Depends: rustc, cargo, pkg-config, libssl-dev
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ca-certificates
Recommends: alsa-utils | espeak
Homepage: https://github.com/thepinak503/echomind
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/thepinak503/echomind
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/thepinak503/echomind.git
License: MIT
Description: A powerful, lightweight AI CLI tool that pipes input to multiple AI chat APIs
 .
 Echomind is a command-line interface for AI chat APIs including OpenAI, Claude, 
 Gemini, Ollama, Grok, Mistral, Cohere, and ChatAnywhere. It features streaming 
 responses, interactive mode, and advanced options for temperature, tokens, and 
 model selection. Supports Linux, macOS, and Windows.

